          "text": "For any quarter, at the end of any business day, in which Undrawn Availability plus the amount of Borrowers’ invested cash on hand is less than $5,000,000, cause to be maintained a Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of not less than 1.05 to 1.0 for the twelve month period ending as of the end of the fiscal quarter being tested.’’ 2."
        }
      ]
    }
